nd constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/external/live_jira_cloud_mutation/_cloud_mutation_support.py:1-21` — Preserve bounded blast radius, unique labels, primary deletion, and sweep backstops. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/external/live_jira_cloud_mutation/conftest.py:1-9` — Preserve canary enrollment and cleanup role. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/external/live_jira_cloud_mutation/test_cloud_coordinator_lifecycle.py:1-20` — Preserve public-facade boundary, one-plan scope, live-write safety, and teardown guarantees. Consumer: none found.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] Every listed location contains only current, non-obvious rationale or constraints after remediation; verified by reviewing the final diff against every Scope row.\n- [ ] Every preserve item and consumer contract in Scope remains explicit and accurate; verified by a row-by-row completion comment and the commands under Verification.\n- [ ] No executable behavior or test assertion changes; verified by the commands under Verification exiting 0.\n\n## Verification\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" .venv/bin/python scripts/check_comment_hygiene.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest --collect-only tests/external/live_jira_cloud_mutation/_cloud_mutation_support.py tests/external/live_jira_cloud_mutation/conftest.py tests/external/live_jira_cloud_mutation/test_cloud_coordinator_lifecycle.py`\n\nThe row-by-row diff review is authoritative for prose quality; the hygiene guard detects only its narrow deterministic history-token rule.","env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","file_impact":[{"path":"tests/external/live_jira_cloud_mutation/_cloud_mutation_support.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/external/live_jira_cloud_mutation/conftest.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."},{"path":"tests/external/live_jira_cloud_mutation/test_cloud_coordinator_lifecycle.py","reason":"Condense comments/docstrings while preserving the scoped contract."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","2d43-3c39-307e-4450"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"2d43-3c39-307e-4450","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":["rebar"],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["comments","documentation","maintainability","grouped-remediation"],"ticket_id":"e9de-5f68-6a83-42e1","ticket_type":"task","title":"Condense comments in tests/external/live_jira_cloud_mutation","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["82393bd0-01d4-445d-b4e4-e4a6aeddd099","a60b343c-4d9a-4861-b88f-0eaf6c99d83b","885d9da9-0444-4988-9ae8-052fc66b934f","df65fa26-535a-4688-b2b6-4e925a82af9f","31339e9b-cbac-47ab-85f5-3fa1e60a923e"]},"env_id":"","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788589198922797373,"uuid":"9b5205e2-0487-425c-b5f1-7cfd30384567"}